graph TD
    subgraph Data Layer
        A[Financial Transaction Stream / CSV] --> B[Data Cleaning & Integrity Engine]
        B --> C[Missing Values & Outlier Sanitization]
    end

    subgraph Feature Engineering
        C --> D[Balance Discrepancy Calculator]
        C --> E[Account Drain Flag Detector]
        C --> F[Temporal & Log Transformations]
        D & E & F --> G[23-Dimensional Feature Matrix]
    end

    subgraph Analytics & Modeling Layer
        G --> H[Supervised Classifiers: RF / XGBoost / LR]
        G --> I[Unsupervised Isolation Forest]
        H --> J[Fraud Probability Estimation P_Fraud]
        I --> K[Behavioral Anomaly Score A_Score]
    end

    subgraph Decision & Explainability Layer
        J & K --> L[Tri-Tier Composite Risk Matrix: LOW / MED / HIGH]
        L --> M[Rule-Based Explainability Engine]
        M --> N[Audit Diagnostics & Severity Indicators]
    end

    subgraph Presentation Layer
        N --> O[Interactive Streamlit Dashboard]
        O --> P1[Overview & KPI Cards]
        O --> P2[Transaction Analytics]
        O --> P3[Fraud Analysis & Drain Patterns]
        O --> P4[Anomaly Outlier Visualizer]
        O --> P5[Real-Time Transaction Predictor]
        O --> P6[Model Performance & PR/ROC Curves]
    end
